        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "Synthetic policy 11 / 合成政策",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 0
        },
        "style": "Title"
      },
      {
        "id": "blk_ad0a76adb81d05a7c1b8e903",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "培训报销的提交期限为11个工作日。",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 1
        },
        "style": "Heading 2"
      },
      {
        "id": "blk_7a08ad6e39c822d8faae6a63",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "培训报销的审批责任人为培训组。",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 2
        },
        "style": "Normal"
      },
      {
        "id": "blk_1f5951e2d9a77c69fea9bec4",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "培训报销必须提供结课证书。",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 3
        },
        "style": "Normal"
      },
      {
        "id": "blk_30c1a3e168d46b4b0680cfeb",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "培训报销记录须保留19个月。",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 4
        },
        "style": "Normal"
      },
      {
        "id": "blk_3a24ea0c67ed7accf89ade0c",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "培训报销的紧急例外需要部门负责人书面批准。",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 5
        },
        "style": "Normal"
      },
      {
        "id": "blk_3bce8c58bea0444fad98ecca",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "培训报销必须通过培训平台提交。",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 6
        },
        "style": "Normal"
      },
      {
        "id": "blk_e27531bafb1419afef41e942",
        "kind": "header",
        "text": "Synthetic benchmark — not business policy",
        "anchor": {
